description	"Jorak Uln

An insane and fragile caster with ancient knowledge and experiences.

^2Weaponry:
- Torturous Melee
-- 20% Slower Swing Rate
-- Force Focuses/Cripples On Hit
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
- Lightning-Surged Double-Bladed Saber (Staff)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Deflect (1)
-- 80 Damage
-- Knocks Back/Knocks Down/Pulses
- Advanced Force Plague ^3[Poison Thrower Weapon]
-- Mag Reload
-- Force Focuses Target, Cripples
- Sith Alchemical Traps (Trip Mines 3)
-- Inflict Poison And Knockdown

^5Force Powers:
- Force Jump (1)
- Force Push (3)
- Force Pull (2) 
- Force Absorb (1)
- Ancient Force Lightning (3) ^3[CS2]
-- Ignites and Cripples
- Force Drain (3) ^3[CS3]
- Force Grip (3) ^3[CS4]
- Force Mind Trick (2)
- Force Saber Throw ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Mental Fortitude (Anti-Mind Trick 2)
- Shrouded Presence (Force Sense Immunity)"
